{"kind":"sentence","lang":"en","entities":{"4987":{"renderings":[{"id":"6ce5fdf69441e180","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"1583"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Poor is not the one who has too little, but the one who wants too much."}]},"78767":{"renderings":[{"id":"1da90669396d8c68","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"324949"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"His greed brought him low."}]},"78768":{"renderings":[{"id":"ed046728763cf7d3","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"324948"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The greedy man was by no means satisfied with the reward."}]},"78769":{"renderings":[{"id":"99fc5a5931d8f681","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"324947"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Greed seems to have blinded his good judgement."}]},"99167":{"renderings":[{"id":"333c2a7611fc58d0","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"304532"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"He is a man of few wants."}]},"105230":{"renderings":[{"id":"7cb1ce8680a61f7f","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"298460"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"He is selfish and greedy."}]},"113594":{"renderings":[{"id":"b160867e2ae2d84c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"290079"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"He was anxious for fame."}]},"120572":{"renderings":[{"id":"dc6983020e15b0c2","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"249981"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I can't make out what he wants."}]},"156841":{"renderings":[{"id":"ddd9bdcfeeb52288","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"257694"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I don't have much desire for wealth."}]},"179642":{"renderings":[{"id":"1bddd1e32eabd414","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"18500"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Love of money is common to all men."}]},"179643":{"renderings":[{"id":"ecea63dd6f60d6e6","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"18501"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I think the love of money is common to us all."}]},"179666":{"renderings":[{"id":"48c230eec2e2fc94","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"18525"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The richer he became, the more he wanted."}]},"193391":{"renderings":[{"id":"e6f24fd4d4eb1426","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"30556"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Of course Darwin, like many of his contemporaries, wished to be seen as following the Newtonian method."}]},"204224":{"renderings":[{"id":"06e77847563065c3","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"41466"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Don't be so greedy or you'll wind up with nothing."}]},"2375406":{"renderings":[{"id":"3a213ad0b1c043cb","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"2378774"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"He's not beaten by the rain; he's not beaten by the wind; neither the snow nor the heat of the summer will beat him; his body is robust, without greed; he never angers, but is always serenely smiling."}]},"4102651":{"renderings":[{"id":"13cbb0fc1b9e2a9b","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"9988125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Appetite is one of humankind's three primal needs, alongside sleep and sexual desire."}]}}}